id=product_abilist
name=Product partition CPU ABI list
author=Robertgarciaa
description=product/etc/build.prop ships neither abilist32 nor abilist64; real init's ro.product.cpu.abilist32 resolves empty at runtime, aborting app_process32/zygote_secondary. Declares them explicitly on product (highest-priority partition in init's resolution order) using the values odm/vendor/system already agree on.
